Dear Authors and the-science.com subscribers,

we apologize, if you have received multiple copies of this message. In this 
newsletter we would like to inform you about deadlines and news for upcoming 
conferences.

---------------------
 UPCOMING CONFERENCES
---------------------
* ARSA 2013 announces Extension of Submission Deadline to November 24th, 2013.
ARSA is very popular event between researchers and it proposes a spectral view
on current research.  It runs currently for the 2nd time.

* QUAESTI 2013 announces Extension of Submission Deadline to December 8th, 2013.
This event is prepared based on request of researchers, to be able present 
their result on time end of the year. 

* GV 2014 announces Call for Paper for the year 2014 (www.gv-conference.com).
ESSENTIAL INFORMATION

All submitted articles will go through double tier evaluation (Scientific 
Committee review and Formal check). Only English texts are processed. All 
accepted articles will be published in the conference proceedings with ISBN and 
ISSN, and they will be included in conference online archive.  Conference 
Archive is indexed in GScholar and it will be sent for evaluation into most 
known indexing and abstracting services. Top rated papers will sent for 
consideration in partnership journals. 

Technical and scientific papers describing original, previously unpublished 
work are solicited in the areas of current scientific fields.

---------------- 
MORE INFORMATION
----------------
For more information, please visit www.the-science.com or send us email: 
info@quaesti.com.

Thank you for your time and trust.

the-science.com team
Thomson Ltd., Slovakia

----------------
If you do not want to receive this newsletter, contact us at: 
unsubscribe@the-science.com

